+
+I'm so sorry both glazed planters from order MP-20108 arrived broken. That's not the welcome we want for anything from Marlowe & Pine.
+
+About your refund: I've sent your request for the full $180 to our billing review team. They handle refunds of this size, and they'll process it back to the card you used for the order. You'll hear from us once it's done.
+
+To make up for the hassle, I've added $15 in store credit to your account. That's the most goodwill credit I'm able to offer on a single case, so I can't match the $30 you asked for. I hope it still helps a little, and it's ready to use on your next order.
+
+Thank you for letting us know, and I'm sorry again for the trouble.
+
+Warmly,
+The Marlowe & Pine Crew
